      "writtenOn": "2023-06-09T04:07:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question.  I did testing for these options, below options can be disabled on aarch64 and Android doesn\u0027t rely on them:\n\nCONFIG_XEN_BALLOON\nCONFIG_XEN_BALLOON_MEMORY_HOTPLUG\nCONFIG_XEN_SCRUB_PAGES_DEFAULT\nCONFIG_XEN_DEV_EVTCHN\nCONFIG_XEN_BACKEND\nCONFIG_XENFS\nCONFIG_XEN_SYS_HYPERVISOR\n\nBut I see below configurations are enabled by default for aarch64 / Xen:\n\nCONFIG_SWIOTLB_XEN\u003dy\nCONFIG_XEN_EFI\u003dy\nCONFIG_XEN_AUTO_XLATE\u003dy\n\nHave uploaded the patch for the minimal Xen configurations.",
      "parentUuid": "b18f3ae1_08dedfea",
